(vector (map (:adr/authoritative_for (vector "8 cloud-itonami blueprints (plumbing isco-7126, construction F4211,\n    freight-driving isco-8332, freight-transport H4920, home-nursing\n    isco-2221, care-coordination Q8810, market-gardening isco-6112, retail\n    G4711) each get a standalone network-isekai game under\n    public/games/itonami/<slug>/ (game.edn + scene.edn + logic.cljc,\n    kami-clj guest subset, auto-discovered by isekai.feed-index)" "shared 'depot loop' mechanic maps the blueprint's intake→propose→\n    approve→execute→audit operating-states onto network-isekai primitives:\n    depot touch = governor approval (defatom equipped flag), job-site touch\n    while equipped = execute (spawns done/score/picked markers, resets\n    equipped), touch while unequipped = governor violation (docks a life\n    marker, cooldown-gated), :flow :victory :when-picked <job-count> = audit\n    close-out, :flow :gameover :when-missing player on 0 lives" "sprites stay hand-composed kami.sprite2d primitives (drive/orbs/\n    goriketsu convention), not kami-isekai-assets chargen — different genre\n    register (trade/care/logistics sim vs isekai/tensei RPG)" "pilot scope only: 8 of 111 cloud-itonami repos, not a batch job over the\n    full registry; prototypes are uncommitted in the working tree pending\n    review before push")), (:adr/supersedes (vector)), (:adr/superseded_by (vector)), (:adr/topic "cloud-itonami-network-isekai-job-simulators"), (:adr/related (vector "adr-2607011000" "adr-2607012000" "adr-2607021900" "adr-2607022340")), (:adr/status "accepted"), (:adr/id "adr-2607031000-cloud-itonami-network-isekai-job-simulators"), (:adr/doc_type "adr"), (:adr/last_verified "2026-07-03"), (:adr/body "see 2607031000-cloud-itonami-network-isekai-job-simulators.edn"), (:adr/deciders (vector "Jun Kawasaki")), (:adr/date "2026-07-03"), (:db/id -1), (:adr/authoritative true), (:adr/title "ADR-2607031000: cloud-itonami × network-isekai — occupation/business job-simulator games"), (:adr/source-format "edn")))